entries[233697] = { ["name"] = "Stormcaller's Spaulders", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Mail\n371 Armor\n+9 Strength\n+27 Stamina\n+8 Intellect\nDurability 85 / 85\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Increased Defense +13.\n\nStormcaller's Resolve (0/5)\nStormcaller's Faceguard\nStormcaller's Spaulders\nStormcaller's Chestguard\nStormcaller's Legplates\nStormcaller's Sabatons\n(2) Set : Damaging a target with Stormstrike, Lava Burst, or Molten Blast also reduces all damage you take by 10% for 10 sec.\n(4) Set : When your Spirit of the Alpha is cast on yourself, it also increases your health by 5%, your threat generated by 25%, and all damage you deal by 5%." }
