entries[233699] = { ["name"] = "Stormcaller's Breastplate", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Mail\n553 Armor\n+40 Strength\n+22 Stamina\n+24 Intellect\nDurability 140 / 140\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 1%.\n\nStormcaller's Impact (0/5)\nStormcaller's Crown\nStormcaller's Mantle\nStormcaller's Breastplate\nStormcaller's Chain Leggings\nStormcaller's Treads\n(2) Set : Increases Stormstrike and Lava Lash damage by 50%. This effect is increased to 100% if using a two-handed weapon.\n(4) Set : Your Stormstrike, Lava Lash and Lava Burst critical strikes cause your target to burn for 30% of the damage done over 4 sec." }
