entries[236032] = { ["name"] = "Bonescythe Belt", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nWaist Leather\n142 Armor\n+17 Agility\n+29 Stamina\nDurability 40 / 40\nClasses: Rogue\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 1%.\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Increased Defense +13.\n\nBonescythe Leathers (0/9)\nBonescythe Mask\nBonescythe Mantle\nBonescythe Chestguard\nBonescythe Belt\nBonescythe Leggings\nBonescythe Treads\nBonescythe Wristguards\nBonescythe Grips\nBonescythe Band\n(2) Set : Your Tease ability never misses, and your chance to be Dodged or Parried is reduced by 2%.\n(4) Set : Reduces the cooldown on your Evasion ability by 2 min and reduces the cooldown on your Blade Flurry ability by 1 min.\n(6) Set : Any damage from an Undead attacker which would otherwise kill you will instead reduce you to 10% of your maximum health (or your current health, whichever is lower). In addition, all damage taken from Undead will be reduced by 90% for 3 sec. This effect cannot occur more than once per minute." }
