entries[236041] = { ["name"] = "Ring of the Cryptstalker", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped: Desecrated Ring (1)\nFinger\n+25 Agility\nClasses: Hunter\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: +29 ranged Attack Power.\n\nCryptstalker Armor (0/9)\nCryptstalker Headpiece\nCryptstalker Spaulders\nCryptstalker Tunic\nCryptstalker Girdle\nCryptstalker Legguards\nCryptstalker Boots\nCryptstalker Wristguards\nCryptstalker Handguards\nRing of the Cryptstalker\n(2) Set : Reduces the cooldown on Chimera Shot, Explosive Shot, and Aimed Shot by 1.5 sec, Kill Shot by 3 sec, and Multi-Shot by 3 sec.\n(4) Set : Your Serpent Sting deals 20% more damage.\n(6) Set : You gain 2% increased damage and critical damage done to Undead for 30 sec each time you hit an Undead enemy with a ranged attack, stacking up to 7 times." }
