entries[236059] = { ["name"] = "Plagueheart Sandals", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nFeet Cloth\n89 Armor\n+10 Stamina\n+11 Intellect\n+17 Spirit\nDurability 50 / 50\nClasses: Warlock\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\nEquip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 30.\n\nPlagueheart Raiment (0/9)\nPlagueheart Circlet\nPlagueheart Shoulderpads\nPlagueheart Belt\nPlagueheart Leggings\nPlagueheart Sandals\nPlagueheart Bindings\nPlagueheart Gloves\nPlagueheart Robe\nPlagueheart Ring\n(2) Set : Increases the damage done by your Incinerate and Corruption abilities by 20%.\n(4) Set : Your non-periodic critical strikes cause your active Corruption, Immolate, Shadowflame, and Unstable Affliction spells on the target to immediately deal a tick of damage at 33% effectiveness.\n(6) Set : Your Curse of Agony also applies the effects of Curse of Recklessness. In addition, it does not expire on Undead targets and continues to grow in power indefinitely." }
