entries[236201] = { ["name"] = "Dreamwalker Bracers", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nWrist Leather\n181 Armor\n+8 Strength\n+7 Agility\n+18 Stamina\nDurability 40 / 40\nClasses: Druid\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 1%.\nEquip: Increases your attack speed by 1%.\nEquip: Increased Defense +8.\n\nDreamwalker Guardian (0/9)\nDreamwalker Headdress\nDreamwalker Pauldrons\nDreamwalker Armor\nDreamwalker Waistguard\nDreamwalker Leggings\nDreamwalker Sabatons\nDreamwalker Bracers\nDreamwalker Gauntlets\nLoop of the Dreamwalker\n(2) Set : Your Growl ability never misses, and your chance to be Dodged or Parried is reduced by 2%.\n(4) Set : Reduces the cooldown on your Survival Instincts by 2 min, and reduces the cooldown on your Berserk ability by 2 min.\n(6) Set : When you take damage from an Undead enemy, the remaining duration of your active Frenzied Regeneration is reset to 10 sec. In addition, Frenzied Regeneration will never consume your last 15 Rage to generate healing." }
